WEBVTT

00:04:55.807 --> 00:05:04.866
(Glazba)

00:05:04.866 --> 00:05:07.451
Zapravo mogu mnogo toga raditi. Mogu svirati

00:05:07.451 --> 00:05:09.949
gudalom violine. Ne moram koristiti štapiće za jelo.

00:05:09.949 --> 00:05:17.802
Tako dobijemo ovaj zvuk. (Glazba)

00:05:17.802 --> 00:05:19.846
A s bankom žive elektronike

00:05:19.846 --> 00:05:23.967
mogu potpuno promijeniti zvuk.(Glazba)

00:05:23.967 --> 00:05:33.041
(Glazba)